{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"诗篇","commonName":"诗篇","title":"诗篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a6689b3544af059e6077f6a9b93d6c43499c5f9692b20ed9d590c493ca23457","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["求助的晚祷"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大卫的诗，交给乐长，用弦乐器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"称我为义人的上帝啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼求的时候，求你回答。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾救我脱离困境，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在求你怜悯我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"垂听我的祷告。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人啊！你们把我的荣耀变为羞辱要到何时呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们爱慕虚妄、追求虚谎要到何时呢？（细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要知道，耶和华已经把敬虔人分别出来，归祂自己。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼求的时候，祂必垂听。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要战战兢兢，不要犯罪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躺在床上的时候要默然思想。（细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要献上公义的祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并信靠耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"许多人说：“谁会善待我们呢？”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你的圣容光照我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使我比那收获五谷新酒的人更喜乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，只有你使我安然居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必高枕无忧。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}